{"ticker":"NUE","updated":"2026-10-30T23:02:06Z","profile":{"longName":"Nucor Corporation","shortName":"Nucor Corporation","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","country":"United States","website":"https://nucor.com","fullTimeEmployees":33000,"marketCap":62134439936,"trailingPE":17.443949,"forwardPE":12.703579,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.6002071,"pegRatio":5.21,"targetMeanPrice":291.875,"targetHighPrice":335.0,"targetLowPrice":226.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.32,"earningsGrowth":1.205,"grossMargins":0.17392,"operatingMargins":0.1673,"profitMargins":0.092609994,"totalRevenue":38828998656,"beta":1.852,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":280.11,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":140.93,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.81},"summary":"Nucor Corporation engages in the manufacture and sale of steel and steel products. The company operates in three segments: Steel Mills, Steel Products, and Raw Materials. The Steel Mills segment produces hot-rolled, cold-rolled, and galvanized sheet steel products; plate steel products; wide-flange beams, beam blanks, and H-piling and sheet piling structural steel products; and bar steel products, such as blooms, billets, concrete reinforcing and merchant bars, and engineered special bar quality products. This segment sells its products to steel service centers, fabricators, and manufacturers in the United States, Canada, and Mexico, as well as engages in the steel trading and rebar distribution businesses. The Steel Products segment offers steel joists and joist girders, steel decks, and galvanized torque tubes for use in solar arrays, hollow structural section steel tubing, electrical conduit, fabricated concrete reinforcing steel, cold finished steel, steel fasteners, steel grating and expanded metal, wire and wire mesh, metal building systems, insulated metal panels, steel racking, overhead doors, and utility towers and structures for communications and energy transmission. This segment is also involved in the piling distribution business. The Raw Materials segment produces direct reduced iron (DRI); brokers ferrous and nonferrous metals, pig iron, hot briquetted iron, and ","summary_zh":"紐柯公司從事鋼鐵及鋼鐵產品的製造和銷售。該公司分為三個部門：鋼鐵廠部門、鋼鐵產品部門和原料部門。鋼廠部門生產熱軋、冷軋及鍍鋅鋼板產品；鋼板製品；寬翼緣梁、梁坯、H型樁、板樁結構鋼產品；及棒材產品，如大方坯、鋼坯、混凝土鋼筋及商用棒材，以及工程特殊棒材優質產品。該部門向美國、加拿大和墨西哥的鋼鐵服務中心、製造商和製造商銷售產品，並從事鋼鐵貿易和螺紋鋼分銷業務。鋼鐵產品部門提供用於太陽能電池陣列的鋼托樑和托樑、鋼甲板和鍍鋅扭矩管、空心結構型鋼管、電氣管道、裝配式混凝土鋼筋、冷加工鋼、鋼緊固件、鋼格板和鋼板網、金屬絲網、金屬建築系統、絕緣金屬板、鋼架、高架門以及用於通信和能源傳輸的公用塔和結構。該分部也涉足打樁分銷業務。原料部門生產直接還原鐵（DRI）；黑金屬和有色金屬、生鐵、熱壓塊鐵和","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"鋼","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":145.96,"h":147.0,"l":144.05,"c":146.4,"v":1202300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":146.19,"h":146.19,"l":142.73,"c":145.21,"v":1125000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":144.9,"h":145.16,"l":142.3,"c":144.94,"v":1141000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":146.53,"h":150.24,"l":145.28,"c":147.26,"v":1374700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":147.58,"h":147.58,"l":143.53,"c":144.02,"v":2331300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":144.72,"h":146.12,"l":140.98,"c":141.02,"v":1689700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":141.42,"h":143.75,"l":141.17,"c":141.88,"v":1439200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":141.78,"h":145.67,"l":141.58,"c":143.75,"v":1515200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":143.28,"h":143.58,"l":141.26,"c":141.35,"v":929900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":141.1,"h":142.17,"l":139.22,"c":141.57,"v":1548000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":142.64,"h":144.92,"l":141.99,"c":142.93,"v":2037300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":141.99,"h":146.42,"l":141.0,"c":142.8,"v":1485600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":136.0,"h":138.1,"l":133.79,"c":134.3,"v":3676100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":134.59,"h":134.75,"l":132.65,"c":133.3,"v":4919200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":133.05,"h":135.63,"l":131.93,"c":134.68,"v":2225400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":135.28,"h":138.1,"l":134.58,"c":135.26,"v":1828100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":134.58,"h":136.57,"l":134.58,"c":136.4,"v":1669400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":135.81,"h":136.66,"l":134.7,"c":134.76,"v":1701200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":135.06,"h":138.56,"l":135.0