ng business. Most of the Company's operating facilities and customers are located in North America. The Company's operations include international trading and sales companies that buy and sell steel and steel products manufactured by the Company and others.","zh":"紐柯公司 (Nucor Corporation) 是一家特拉華州公司，成立於 1958 年，其附屬公司（「紐柯」、「公司」、「我們」或「我們的」）生產鋼鐵和鋼鐵產品。該公司還生產和採購黑色金屬和有色金屬材料，主要用於其鋼鐵製造業務。該公司的大部分營運設施和客戶位於北美。該公司的業務包括國際貿易和銷售公司，購買和銷售該公司和其他公司生產的鋼鐵和鋼鐵產品。"},{"en":"Nucor is North America's largest recycler, using scrap steel as the primary raw material in producing steel and steel products. In 2025, we recycled approximately 20 million gross tons of scrap steel.","zh":"紐柯鋼鐵公司是北美最大的回收商，使用廢鋼作為生產鋼鐵和鋼鐵產品的主要原料。 2025年，我們回收廢鋼約2,000萬噸。"},{"en":"Nucor reports its results in three segments: steel mills, steel products and raw materials. The steel mills segment is Nucor's largest segment, representing 62% of the Company's sales to external customers in the year ended December 31, 2025.","zh":"紐柯公司報告了三個部門的表現：鋼廠、鋼鐵產品和原材料。鋼廠業務是紐柯最大的業務，占公司截至2025年12月31日止年度對外客戶銷售額的62%。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We have a diverse customer base and are not dependent on any single customer. Our largest single customer in 2025 represented approximately 5% of sales and consistently pays within terms. Our steel mills use a significant portion of the products of the raw materials segment while our steel products segment uses approximately 21% of our steel mills' output.","zh":"我們擁有多元化的客戶群，不依賴任何單一客戶。 2025 年，我們最大的單一客戶約佔銷售額的 5%，並且始終按照條款付款。我們的鋼廠使用原料部門的很大一部分產品，而我們的鋼鐵產品部門使用我們鋼廠產量的約21%。"},{"en":"Nonresidential construction is the largest end-use market that we serve. Products from our steel mills and steel products segments are used in a variety of nonresidential construction applications (e.g., commercial, industrial and infrastructure).","zh":"非住宅建築是我們服務的最大的最終用途市場。我們的鋼廠和鋼鐵產品部門的產品用於各種非住宅建築應用（例如商業、工業和基礎設施）。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete in a variety of steel and metal markets, including markets for finished steel products, unfinished steel products and raw materials. These markets are highly competitive with many domestic and foreign firms participating, and, as a result of this highly competitive environment, we find that we primarily compete on price and service.","zh":"我們在各種鋼鐵和金屬市場上競爭，包括成品鋼材、未成品鋼材和原料市場。這些市場競爭激烈，有許多國內外公司參與，由於這種競爭激烈的環境，我們發現我們主要在價格和服務上競爭。"},{"en":"In our steel mills segment, our EAF steel mills face many different forms of competition, including domestic integrated steel producers (who use iron ore converted into liquid form in a blast furnace as their basic raw material instead of scrap steel), other domestic EAF steel mills, steel imports and alternative materials. Large domestic integrated steel producers have the ability to manufacture a variety of products but are often burdened with higher capital and fixed operating costs. EAF-based steel producers, such as Nucor, are more sensitive to increases in scrap prices but tend to have lower capital and fixed operating costs compared with large integrated steel producers. EAF-based steel producers also typically emit fewer GHGs per ton of steel produced than integrated steel producers.","zh":"在我們的鋼廠領域，我們的電爐鋼廠面臨多種不同形式的競爭，包括國內綜合鋼鐵生產商（他們使用在高爐中轉化為液態的鐵礦石作為基本原材料而不是廢鋼）、其他國內電爐鋼廠、鋼材進口和替代材料。國內大型綜合鋼鐵生產商有能力生產多種產品，但往往背負較高的資本和固定營運成本。紐柯等電弧爐鋼鐵生產商對廢鋼價格上漲更為敏感，但與大型綜合鋼鐵生產商相比，其資本和固定營運成本往往較低。基於電弧爐的鋼鐵生產商每生產一噸鋼排放的溫室氣體通常也比綜合鋼鐵生產商少。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Steel Mills","val":20003000000,"zh":"鋼鐵廠"},{"name":"Steel Products","val":10327000000,"zh":"鋼鐵產品"},{"name":"Raw Materials","val":2164000000,"zh":"原料"}],"total":32494000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Sheet","val":9156000000,"zh":"床單"},{"name":"Bar","val":5723000000,"zh":"酒吧"},{"name":"Other Steel Products","val":3522000000,"zh":"其他鋼鐵產品"},{"name":"Structural","val":2632000000,"zh":"結構性"},{"name":"Plate","val":2492000000,"zh":"盤子"},{"name":"Joist & Deck","val":2217000000,"zh":"托樑和甲板"},{"name":"Raw Materials","val":2164000000,"zh":"原料"},{"name":"Rebar Fabrication","val":1910000000,"zh":"鋼筋製造"},{"name":"Tubular Products","val":1429000000,"zh":"管狀產品"},{"name":"Building Systems","val":1249000000,"zh":"建築系統"}],"total":32494000000}},"peers":["STLD","CLF","FCX","PPG","EMR"]}}